member.summary:
TRN_PurchaseOrder — anything the company buys (document §4).
            Tax here is the supplier's GST as printed on their quote, entered by the buyer;
            it is NOT sourced from Tax.* in MST_AppSetting, which models our OUTPUT GST.

Monthly rate for a cabin or dedicated desk. Quotations price cabins and
            desks by the month (document §2.1), which hourly and daily rates cannot express;
            null means no standard monthly price is configured and the admin types one.
